tags: $:/tags/ControlPanel
title: $:/plugins/breakzplatform/github-comments/settings/settings
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki
caption: Github comments

<$list filter="[[$:/ControlPanel]!is[current]]">
    Configuration for the plugin can be done from within the Github comments tab in the [[ControlPanel|$:/ControlPanel]] as well.
</$list>
<$list filter="[[$:/ControlPanel]is[current]]">
    Configuration for the [[Github comments plugin|$:/plugins/breakzplatform/github-comments]].
</$list>

|[[Service|$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/provider]] |<$select tiddler="$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/provider" default="auto"><option value="auto">Automatic</option><option value="giscus">giscus (GitHub Discussions)</option><option value="utterances">utterances (GitHub Issues)</option></$select><br/>//''Automatic'' uses giscus when its repository and category IDs are filled in, and utterances otherwise.// |
|[[GitHub Repository|$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/repo]] |<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/repo" default="" tag="input"/><br/>//Use ''user/repo'' format. For example ''breakzplatform/tw5-github-comments'' // |
|[[Website's URL|$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/url]] |<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/url" default="" tag="input"/><br/>//For example ''breakzplatform.github.io'' or ''joseli.to/pt''. // |
|[[Theme|$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/theme]]|<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/theme" default="" tag="input"/><br/>//Common names like ''github-light'', ''github-dark'' and ''preferred-color-scheme'' work with both services.// |
|[[Filter|$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/filter]]<blockquote>Which tiddlers would you like to comment on?</blockquote> |<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/filter" default="" tag="input"/> |
|[[Show label text|$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/label-show]]|<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/label-show" default="" tag="input"/> |
|[[Hide label text|$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/label-hide]]|<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/label-hide" default="" tag="input"/> |

!! giscus

//Copy these values from the configuration generated at [[giscus.app|https://giscus.app]].//

|[[Repository ID|$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/repo-id]] |<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/repo-id" default="" tag="input"/><br/>//''data-repo-id''// |
|[[Discussion category|$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/category]] |<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/category" default="" tag="input"/><br/>//''data-category''. For example ''Announcements''// |
|[[Category ID|$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/category-id]] |<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/category-id" default="" tag="input"/><br/>//''data-category-id''// |
|[[Language|$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/lang]] |<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/breakzplatform/github-comments/lang" default="" tag="input"/><br/>//For example ''en'' or ''pt''// |